1332	/** Characters kept of a resumed conversation's entries: tool names and subjects are short, messages are bounded. */
1333	/** Approvals that change what the operator asked for: never covered by a blanket approval, always an explicit decision. */
1334	const DELIBERATE_APPROVAL = "steering_conflict";
